OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a dry start, with local
OL,6,Ffrost and fog patches, cloud will
OL,7,Fthicken from the south. Outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain will then spread north and east
OL,9,Fin the afternoon, perhaps heavy and
OL,10,Fpersistent in places. Chilly, with a
OL,11,Fgentle breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with rain then showers
OL,14,Fovernight. Becoming cold, with frost
OL,15,Fdeveloping across western parts and
OL,16,Fover higher ground. Risk of icy
OL,17,Fstretches on untreated surfaces.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
