OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloudy with outbreaks of light
OL,6,Frain at first. Dry with sunny spells
OL,7,Ffrom late morning. Increasingly windy
OL,8,Fand cloudy overnight, with rain and a
OL,9,Fchance of snow over hills. Cold.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fand unsettled, with spells of rain and
OL,13,Fstrong winds at times Tuesday to
OL,14,FThursday. Remaining generally cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
